               <problem id="prob-00019">
                  <para id="para-00096">For each equation for questions 7 – 12, identify the values of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>, and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> that you would substitute into the quadratic formula to solve the equation.</para>
