                  <para id="para-00100">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
                  <para id="para-00101">Try again. Revisit activity 9.6.3.</para>
                  <para id="para-00102">The correct answer is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
               </solution>
